[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     21[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Two properties worth stating explicitly, because both look like bugs and both
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m are reproduced deliberately rather than "fixed":
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     25[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `bad()` evaluates `intOne + intTwo;` as a bare expression statement and throws
