[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     27[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   translation keeps this (`let _ = int_one + int_two;`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     28[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `printLine` guards on `line != NULL`, but every call site passes a string
